  '鍵盤連線 / 車站清單':'Keyboard connections / Station list',
  '選路線後依序按車站。兩站即開通；端點＋新站可延伸，中間站＋新站可插站並保留兩側。分支可另選一條線從共站接出。Esc 取消。':'Select a line, then activate stations in order. Two stations start a route. Select an endpoint and a new station to extend it, or an intermediate station and a new station to insert a stop while keeping both sides. To branch, choose another line and start at a shared station. Esc cancels.',
