  '一條線，開始一座城市。':'A city begins with a single line.',
  '：城市選單進入，5 分鐘內右鍵建站（手機用建站工具），以各城實際路線名額自由拉線與配車。可提前啟動，期限到也會整批啟動已完成路線；隨後鎖定配置，運行 10 秒，自動保留站點、路線、乘客及車輛進度，回到下一輪 5 分鐘規劃，持續循環。資源不限、無自動增站與壅塞失敗，側欄記錄累計運量及上一輪完整度；完整度依需求參考覆蓋與連通率計算，不是人口或官方運量預測。':': Enter from city selection. You have 5 minutes to right-click stations onto the map (use the station tool on mobile), draw routes, and assign trains using the city’s real line allocation. Launch early or let the deadline launch all finished routes. The layout locks for a 10-second run, then stations, routes, passengers, and train progress are kept for another 5-minute planning round. This repeats continuously. Resources are unlimited, with no automatic station growth or overcrowding failures. The sidebar shows cumulative ridership and the previous round’s completeness. Completeness measures reference demand coverage and connectivity; it is not a population model or an official ridership forecast.',
  '中段插站':'Insert an intermediate stop',
  '：先選路線，從中間站或線段拖到新站，保留原路線兩側；手機可依序點選。另選一條線從中間站起拉可建立共站轉乘的分支。Esc 可取消草稿。':': Select a line, then drag from an intermediate station or route segment to a new station. Both sides of the original route remain. On mobile, tap the stations in order. Start another line at an intermediate station to create a branch with a shared transfer stop. Esc cancels the draft.',
  '外觀大小':'Display sizes',
  '：開始前調整車站大小、列車大小與路線粗細，範圍 25%–200%，附即時預覽並記住設定。開始後鎖定，暫停也不能修改；返回「城市／模式」結束本局後可重新設定。五城淡色軌道與空心點是歷史回顧同款的實際路網參考，不代表玩家已開通。':': Before starting, adjust station size, train size, and line width from 25% to 200%. The live preview updates immediately and settings are remembered. They lock once play starts, even while paused. Return to City / Mode to end the game and change them. Pale tracks and hollow points in the five real cities show the same real network used in railway history; they are reference overlays, not your operating routes.',
  '城市與目標':'Cities and goals',
  '：香港、台北、紐約、大阪・京都、東京、環海自建城各有送達人數、連通車站與營運路線目標。三項達成即過關，可進下一關或繼續無盡模式。':': Hong Kong, Taipei, New York, Osaka–Kyoto, Tokyo, and Canal City each have targets for delivered passengers, connected stations, and operating lines. Complete all three to finish the challenge, then move to the next city or continue in endless mode.',
  '畫線與轉乘':'Drawing routes and transfers',
  '：選彩色路線，從車站拖曳經過多站，放開套用；亦可逐站點擊，或使用「鍵盤連線／車站清單」。乘客的小形狀表示目的地，多線共站即可轉乘。':': Select a colored line, drag through stations, and release to apply it. You can also tap stations in order or use Keyboard connections / Station list. A passenger’s small shape shows their destination type. Lines sharing a station allow transfers.',
  '紅燈提醒':'Unconnected station alerts',
  '：未連線的車站會閃紅色提醒圈；接入路線後消失。系統設定減少動態效果時改為固定紅圈。':': Unconnected stations flash a red ring until a route connects them. With reduced motion enabled in your system settings, the ring stays solid.',
  '自動模式':'Automatic control',
  '：開啟後參照城市真實站序、分支與轉乘分線，不再把所有站串成一兩條長線。可超過原本五線；孤站暫用最多 8 站的灰色接駁，有真實路線覆蓋後撤回。自動接管可重整目前路網，保留乘客；關閉後保留路網。遵守資源限制，並非最佳解或通關保證；可搭配 BUG 模式。':': Automatic control builds separate lines using the city’s real station order, branches, and transfers. It can use more than five lines. Isolated stations receive temporary gray feeders of up to 8 stops, removed when real corridors serve them. Taking over may reorganize your routes while preserving passengers. Turning it off keeps the network. It follows resource limits and does not guarantee an optimal network or a win. It can be combined with BUG mode.',
  '無盡模式':'Endless mode',
  '：時間與車站持續增加，沒有 22 站上限，壅塞不會結束遊戲。每 70 秒自動補給。城市清單中的全部真實車站用完後，規劃新站依序命名為 1、2、3……；手動與自動模式皆最多新增 50 個，達上限後時間與列車繼續運行。BUG 模式左邊的「規劃新站」可關閉額外增站，再開啟會接續剩餘額度；既有站點與路網保留，真實／官方未來目錄照常開放。':': Time and station growth continue beyond 22 stations, and overcrowding does not end the game. Supplies arrive automatically every 70 seconds. After the real station catalog is exhausted, extra stations are named 1, 2, 3, and so on, up to 50 in either manual or automatic play. Time and trains keep moving at the cap. Extra stations, to the left of BUG mode, can stop this growth; switching it back on resumes the remaining allocation. Existing stations and routes are kept, and real / official future stations still open normally.',
  '調度與修改':'Dispatching and editing',
  '：從端點延伸，拖回前站退一步，連回起點形成至少三站的環線；重畫、縮短末站與撤線可重配。車頭上方 +N 是加掛車廂數，每節增加 6 人容量。':': Extend from an endpoint, drag back to the previous station to undo a step, or return to the starting station to form a loop with at least three stops. Redraw, remove the last stop, or remove a route to revise your network. +N above a train shows added carriages; each adds room for 6 passengers.',
  '營運壓力':'Operating pressure',
  '：目標關卡中，候車超過 6 人且持續壅塞 26 秒會失敗；疏運可回復倒數。一般關卡的週末獎勵選單會暫停，開啟自動模式則自動領取。':': In a city challenge, a station with more than 6 waiting passengers that remains overcrowded for 26 seconds ends the game. Clearing the crowd restores the countdown. Weekly reward selection pauses ordinary challenges; automatic control claims rewards for you.',
  'Space 暫停 · 1–5 選線 · Esc 取消連線':'Space to pause · 1–5 to select a line · Esc to cancel a route',
  '＋／−／滾輪縮放，空白處拖曳平移，「全圖」復位。':'＋ / − / mouse wheel to zoom. Drag empty space to pan. Fit map resets the view.',
  '自動或無盡模式可在背景分頁運行；瀏覽器若暫停背景執行，恢復後逐步補算。請保持分頁開啟，關閉分頁不會繼續營運。本機記錄最高分與過關城市，不保存本局路網。':'Automatic and endless play can run in a background tab. If the browser suspends it, the simulation catches up gradually when resumed. Keep the tab open; service stops when it is closed. High scores and completed cities are saved locally, but the current network is not.',
  '真實站點位置及海岸、河流資料經簡化；玩家自建的路線不是官方現行路網。環海自建城為原創人工大陸，站名隨機取自五城、位置虛構。未來站點與虛線是規劃示意，預期通車時間仍可能變動。':'Real station positions, coastlines, and rivers are simplified. Your routes are your own designs. Canal City is an original artificial continent with randomly selected five-city station names and fictional locations. Future stations and dashed lines are planning illustrations; expected opening dates may change.',
